  "scope_note": "I extracted the substantive statements from the newsletter's interview with the EU Ambassador (Bác Ái pumped storage loan, JETP finance role, Global Gateway) and the RMP project principles, priority categories, and JETP participation method on pages 1-2. I left out the newsletter masthead, contact details, page furniture, headings that are only captions, and the interview link, as out of scope.",
